### Get task detail with comments
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/6a173437-23e2-466e-815f-3ed1a9298066
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### Create task comment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/6a173437-23e2-466e-815f-3ed1a9298066/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "content": "Ahoj, tohle je nový komentář!"
}

### Create another comment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/6a173437-23e2-466e-815f-3ed1a9298066/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
  "content": "Druhý komentář k ověření persistence"
}

### Get task detail again to verify comments were added
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/6a173437-23e2-466e-815f-3ed1a9298066
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
